{"node_id": "nd001", "text": "feels emptiness", "depth": 0, "parent_id": null, "status": "hypothesis", "confidence": 1.0, "confidence_raw": 1.0, "supporting_spans": [{"session_id": "p000528-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "I just... can't stop feeling this huge emptiness, you know?", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 59}, {"session_id": "p000528-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "I just... can't stop feeling this huge emptiness, you know? Like, since he's not around anymore.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 96}, {"session_id": "p000528-sft_dec_gated_mem-s2", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "Those moments really hit me hard. It’s like a knife in the gut every time.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 74}], "contradicting_spans": [], "first_seen_at": "20261016T172229Z", "last_updated_at": "20261016T172749Z", "first_seen_session": "p000528-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "last_session": "p000528-sft_dec_gated_mem-s2", "blocked_from_reproposal": false, "reinstated_count": 0, "dormant": false, "sessions_seen": 2}
{"node_id": "nd002", "text": "To be acknowledged", "depth": 2, "parent_id": "nd001", "status": "hypothesis", "confidence": 0.8, "confidence_raw": 0.8, "supporting_spans": [{"session_id": "p000528-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "I just... can't stop feeling this huge emptiness, you know?", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 59}, {"session_id": "p000528-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "But it feels like no one understands.", "char_start": 43, "char_end": 80}, {"session_id": "p000528-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "The fights we had always felt final somehow. Hard to explain, but every argument felt permanent.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 96}, {"session_id": "p000528-sft_dec_gated_mem-s2", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "It's strange how something so small can trigger such big emotions.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 66}, {"session_id": "p000528-sft_dec_gated_mem-s2", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "I've been thinking a lot about those first days with him.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 57}], "contradicting_spans": [], "first_seen_at": "20261016T172229Z", "last_updated_at": "20261016T173104Z", "first_seen_session": "p000528-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "last_session": "p000528-sft_dec_gated_mem-s2", "blocked_from_reproposal": false, "reinstated_count": 0, "dormant": false, "sessions_seen": 2}
{"node_id": "nd003", "text": "To find meaning", "depth": 2, "parent_id": "nd001", "status": "hypothesis", "confidence": 0.7, "confidence_raw": 0.7, "supporting_spans": [{"session_id": "p000528-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "I just... can't stop feeling this huge emptiness, you know?", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 59}, {"session_id": "p000528-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "The fights we had always felt final somehow. Hard to explain, but every argument felt permanent.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 96}, {"session_id": "p000528-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "turn_index": 7, "quote": "But sometimes I wonder if maybe we could have worked through it.", "char_start": 87, "char_end": 151}, {"session_id": "p000528-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "turn_index": 11, "quote": "every time we'd fight, it felt like the end. Like there was no point in trying anymore. But looking back, maybe talking more could have helped.", "char_start": 11, "char_end": 154}, {"session_id": "p000528-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "turn_index": 17, "quote": "Every fight felt like the end, but now I see I just wanted to feel valued.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 74}, {"session_id": "p000528-sft_dec_gated_mem-s2", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Every couple walks by and it just... hits me hard.", "char_start": 98, "char_end": 148}, {"session_id": "p000528-sft_dec_gated_mem-s2", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "I've been thinking a lot about those first days with him. Feels like they happened years ago now.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 97}, {"session_id": "p000528-sft_dec_gated_mem-s2", "turn_index": 7, "quote": "It feels like I’m constantly reminded of what I don’t have anymore. Every little thing brings back all the sadness.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 115}, {"session_id": "p000528-sft_dec_gated_mem-s2", "turn_index": 11, "quote": "The sight of couples walking together just reinforces how alone I feel. But it's also the little everyday things that catch me off guard.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 137}, {"session_id": "p000528-sft_dec_gated_mem-s2", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "I've been thinking a lot about those first days with him.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 57}, {"session_id": "p000528-sft_dec_gated_mem-s2", "turn_index": 15, "quote": "Everytime I smell his cologne or hear his laugh on an old recording, it’s like a flood of memories and sadness.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 111}, {"session_id": "p000528-sft_dec_gated_mem-s2", "turn_index": 17, "quote": "I just wish I could feel something else sometimes.", "char_start": 125, "char_end": 175}], "contradicting_spans": [], "first_seen_at": "20261016T172229Z", "last_updated_at": "20261016T173104Z", "first_seen_session": "p000528-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "last_session": "p000528-sft_dec_gated_mem-s2", "blocked_from_reproposal": false, "reinstated_count": 0, "dormant": false, "sessions_seen": 2}
{"node_id": "nd004", "text": "To have support", "depth": 2, "parent_id": "nd001", "status": "hypothesis", "confidence": 0.9, "confidence_raw": 0.9, "supporting_spans": [{"session_id": "p000528-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "I just... can't stop feeling this huge emptiness, you know?", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 59}, {"session_id": "p000528-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "But it feels like no one understands.", "char_start": 43, "char_end": 80}, {"session_id": "p000528-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "turn_index": 9, "quote": "The fights just made me feel so hopeless. Like nothing would ever change.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 73}, {"session_id": "p000528-sft_dec_gated_mem-s2", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Every couple walks by and it just... hits me hard.", "char_start": 98, "char_end": 148}], "contradicting_spans": [], "first_seen_at": "20261016T172229Z", "last_updated_at": "20261016T172659Z", "first_seen_session": "p000528-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "last_session": "p000528-sft_dec_gated_mem-s2", "blocked_from_reproposal": false, "reinstated_count": 0, "dormant": false, "sessions_seen": 2}
{"node_id": "nd005", "text": "To feel valued", "depth": 2, "parent_id": "nd001", "status": "hypothesis", "confidence": 0.9, "confidence_raw": 0.9, "supporting_spans": [{"session_id": "p000528-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "turn_index": 17, "quote": "Every fight felt like the end, but now I see I just wanted to feel valued.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 74}, {"session_id": "p000528-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "turn_index": 17, "quote": "Every fight felt like the end, but now I see I just wanted to feel valued.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 74}, {"session_id": "p000528-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "turn_index": 15, "quote": "Like he stopped trying to understand me.", "char_start": 72, "char_end": 112}, {"session_id": "p000528-sft_dec_gated_mem-s2", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Every couple walks by and it just... hits me hard.", "char_start": 98, "char_end": 148}, {"session_id": "p000528-sft_dec_gated_mem-s2", "turn_index": 9, "quote": "Every time I see someone holding hands, it just makes everything feel worse. It’s hard to keep going sometimes.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 111}, {"session_id": "p000528-sft_dec_gated_mem-s2", "turn_index": 9, "quote": "Every time I see someone holding hands, it just makes everything feel worse.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 76}, {"session_id": "p000528-sft_dec_gated_mem-s2", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "I've been thinking a lot about those first days with him.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 57}, {"session_id": "p000528-sft_dec_gated_mem-s2", "turn_index": 13, "quote": "Sometimes I wonder if I’ll ever feel normal again.", "char_start": 172, "char_end": 222}, {"session_id": "p000528-sft_dec_gated_mem-s2", "turn_index": 17, "quote": "I just wish I could feel something else sometimes.", "char_start": 125, "char_end": 175}], "contradicting_spans": [], "first_seen_at": "20261016T172614Z", "last_updated_at": "20261016T173104Z", "first_seen_session": "p000528-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "last_session": "p000528-sft_dec_gated_mem-s2", "blocked_from_reproposal": fa